<description>&lt;b&gt;Raspberry Pi 5 (4/8 GB). D2K V1 compute. Board 85 x 56 mm, 4x M2.5 on 58 x 49.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Connector pin = signal:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PWR&lt;/b&gt; (USB-C power in): A4=VBUS, A5=CC1, A1=GND, B5=CC2&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HDMI0&lt;/b&gt; (micro-HDMI): 3=TMDS_D2+, 4=TMDS_D2_SH, 5=TMDS_D2-, 6=TMDS_D1+, 7=TMDS_D1_SH, 8=TMDS_D1-, 9=TMDS_D0+, 10=TMDS_D0_SH, 11=TMDS_D0-, 12=TMDS_CLK+, 13=TMDS_CLK_SH, 14=TMDS_CLK-, 15=CEC, 2=UTILITY, 17=DDC_SCL, 18=DDC_SDA, 16=DDC_GND, 19=+5V, 1=HPD&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HDMI1&lt;/b&gt; (micro-HDMI): 3=TMDS_D2+, 4=TMDS_D2_SH, 5=TMDS_D2-, 6=TMDS_D1+, 7=TMDS_D1_SH, 8=TMDS_D1-, 9=TMDS_D0+, 10=TMDS_D0_SH, 11=TMDS_D0-, 12=TMDS_CLK+, 13=TMDS_CLK_SH, 14=TMDS_CLK-, 15=CEC, 2=UTILITY, 17=DDC_SCL, 18=DDC_SDA, 16=DDC_GND, 19=+5V, 1=HPD&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DISP0&lt;/b&gt; (CAM/DISP 22p): 1=GND, 2=D0_N, 3=D0_P, 4=GND, 5=D1_N, 6=D1_P, 7=GND, 8=CLK_N, 9=CLK_P, 10=GND, 11=D2_N, 12=D2_P, 13=GND, 14=D3_N, 15=D3_P, 16=GND, 17=IO0, 18=IO1, 19=GND, 20=SCL, 21=SDA, 22=3V3&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DISP1&lt;/b&gt; (CAM/DISP 22p): 1=GND, 2=D0_N, 3=D0_P, 4=GND, 5=D1_N, 6=D1_P, 7=GND, 8=CLK_N, 9=CLK_P, 10=GND, 11=D2_N, 12=D2_P, 13=GND, 14=D3_N, 15=D3_P, 16=GND, 17=IO0, 18=IO1, 19=GND, 20=SCL, 21=SDA, 22=3V3&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GPIO&lt;/b&gt; (40-pin header): 1=3V3, 2=5V, 3=GPIO2_SDA1, 4=5V, 5=GPIO3_SCL1, 6=GND, 7=GPIO4, 8=GPIO14_TXD, 9=GND, 10=GPIO15_RXD, 11=GPIO17, 12=GPIO18_PCM_CLK, 13=GPIO27, 14=GND, 15=GPIO22, 16=GPIO23, 17=3V3, 18=GPIO24, 19=GPIO10_MOSI, 20=GND, 21=GPIO9_MISO, 22=GPIO25, 23=GPIO11_SCLK, 24=GPIO8_CE0, 25=GND, 26=GPIO7_CE1, 27=ID_SD, 28=ID_SC, 29=GPIO5, 30=GND, 31=GPIO6, 32=GPIO12, 33=GPIO13, 34=GND, 35=GPIO19_PCM_FS, 36=GPIO16, 37=GPIO26, 38=GPIO20_PCM_DIN, 39=GND, 40=GPIO21_PCM_DOUT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;USB2_0&lt;/b&gt; (USB 2.0 A): 1=VBUS, 2=D-, 3=D+, 4=GND&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;USB2_1&lt;/b&gt; (USB 2.0 A): 1=VBUS, 2=D-, 3=D+, 4=GND&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;USB3_0&lt;/b&gt; (USB 3.0 A): 1=VBUS, 2=D-, 3=D+, 4=GND, 5=SSRX-, 6=SSRX+, 7=GND_DR