<text x="-40.64" y="33.02" size="3.81" layer="94">D2K V1 - bench interconnect</text>
<text x="-40.64" y="26.67" size="1.778" layer="97">Raspberry Pi 5 on mains USB-C + Waveshare 5inch HDMI LCD (H) upper + Waveshare 4-DSI-TOUCH-A lower touch</text>
<text x="-40.64" y="-175.26" size="1.27" layer="97">Generated by fusion/electronics/gen_d2k_v1_sch.py - warnings and cable details: fusion/wiring.md</text>
